Extensions
══════════

Corpus for Phase 1 markdown constructs added after the initial pipeline.
Accumulates across tasks — add new sections, don't replace old ones.

Task lists (T1.1)
─────────────────

• ☐ unchecked item
• ☑ checked item (lowercase x)
• ☑ checked item (uppercase X)
• plain bullet item, no checkbox

1. ☐ first ordered task
2. ☑ second ordered task, done
3. plain ordered item

• ☑ checked item with continuation second line of the same item, indented under
    the checkbox

Strikethrough (T1.1)
────────────────────

This is ~~deleted text~~ inside a sentence.

~~Whole line struck through.~~

Mixed bold and ~~struck~~ together.

Reference links, titles, images (T1.2)
──────────────────────────────────────

Inline link with title: ]8;;https://www.anthropic.com\Anthropic]8;;\.

Reference link: ]8;;https://example.com/docs\the]8;;\ ]8;;https://example.com/docs\docs]8;;\ explain more.

Collapsed reference: ]8;;https://example.com/docs-ref\Docs]8;;\ ]8;;https://example.com/docs-ref\Ref]8;;\ also works.

Shortcut reference: ]8;;https://example.com/docs-ref\Docs]8;;\ ]8;;https://example.com/docs-ref\Ref]8;;\ resolves the same way.

Undefined reference stays literal: [nowhere][missing-ref].

Undefined shortcut stays literal: [Also Missing].

Image with title: [image: a small logo] (https://example.com/logo.png)

Reference image: [image: alt text] (https://example.com/image.png)

Paren url survives inline: ]8;;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haskell_(programming_language)\Haskell]8;;\ stays whole.

Paren url by reference: ]8;;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haskell_(programming_language)\the]8;;\ ]8;;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haskell_(programming_language)\Haskell]8;;\ ]8;;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haskell_(programming_language)\article]8;;\.

Paren-form title: ]8;;https://example.com/pt\point]8;;\ ]8;;https://example.com/pt\here]8;;\ uses (title) syntax.

Math small fixes (T1.5)
───────────────────────

Cube root: ∛(8). Fourth root: ∜(16). Other index: [5]√(32).

Plain root unaffected: √2.

Nested content under a cube root: ∛(x+y).
